<template><div class="app"><header><b>GLOBAL DUBAI</b><span>☰</span></header><main><div class="eyebrow">DUBAI EXPERIENCES</div><h1>发现你的下一段迪拜旅程</h1><p class="muted">真实库存 · 实时价格 · 在线预订</p><div class="search"><input v-model="keyword" placeholder="搜索体验" @keyup.enter="load"/><button @click="load">搜索</button></div><div class="planner"><div><b>✨ AI Planner</b><p>告诉我预算、天数和想玩的项目，生成可预订行程。</p></div><button>开始规划</button></div><h2>热门体验</h2><div v-if="loading" class="center">加载中…</div><div v-else-if="!products.length" class="center">暂无商品，请先由商户发布旅游产品。</div><article v-for="p in products" :key="p.id" class="card"><div class="cover">{{p.destination||'Dubai'}}</div><div class="body"><small>{{p.code}}</small><h3>{{p.title}}</h3><p>{{p.description||'迪拜精彩体验'}}</p><strong>{{p.currency||'AED'}} {{p.min_price??'--'}}</strong></div></article></main><nav class="bottom"><span>⌂<small>首页</small></span><span>⌕<small>探索</small></span><span>♡<small>收藏</small></span><span>◯<small>我的</small></span></nav></div></template><script setup>import{onMounted,ref}from'vue';const keyword=ref(''),products=ref([]),loading=ref(false);const base=(import.meta.env.VITE_TRAVEL_API_BASE_URL||'http://localhost:9200').replace(/\/$/,'');async function load(){loading.value=true;try{const r=await fetch(`${base}/api/travel/products?keyword=${encodeURIComponent(keyword.value)}`);if(r.ok){const d=await r.json();products.value=d.items||d.data?.items||d.data||[]}}finally{loading.value=false}}onMounted(load)</script>
